[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3000.87, "timestamp": "00:50:00", "text": "媽媽，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3006.95, "timestamp": "00:50:06", "text": "呃，為了藝術，為了職業模特兒的工作，為了官方的狗。他們做得非常好。他們做得非常好。  我完全沒想到他們會製作出這麼精細的美術作品。只是這件事我一直藏在心裡，差不多一年了。不，差不多一年了。如果到了八月，那就差不多一年了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3016.678, "timestamp": "00:50:16", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "It’s 1 am for me😭😭😭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3025.87, "timestamp": "00:50:25", "text": "我一直都想把它展示給大眾看，但是因為種種限制，一直沒能實現。但現在我擺脫了那些煩惱，因為我都是自己思考的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3042.283, "timestamp": "00:50:42", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Stressful-"}]